{"id":"856b3762c593e8c1","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-root-sound-modal-model.md","title":"有限公式集上的根反射可靠性","display":"df-root-sound-modal-model — 有限公式集上的根反射可靠性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-root-sound-modal-model","aliases":["72-df-root-sound-modal-model"],"display":"df-root-sound-modal-model — 有限公式集上的根反射可靠性","depends_on":["[[72-df-modal-adequate-set]]","[[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII Definition2.5, print480/PDF492","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"predicate expansion checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-root-sound-modal-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-root-sound-modal-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-root-sound-modal-model — 有限公式集上的根反射可靠性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"67a60f891de62bc0\" href=\"?note=67a60f891de62bc0\" title=\"72-df-modal-adequate-set\">72-df-modal-adequate-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"91aa38d1fd431425\" href=\"?note=91aa38d1fd431425\" title=\"72-df-modal-kripke-model\">72-df-modal-kripke-model</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII Definition2.5, print480/PDF492"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"predicate expansion checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"91aa38d1fd431425\" href=\"?note=91aa38d1fd431425\" title=\"72-df-modal-kripke-model\">72-df-modal-kripke-model</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_A\">\\(\\Phi_A\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"67a60f891de62bc0\" href=\"?note=67a60f891de62bc0\" title=\"72-df-modal-adequate-set\">72-df-modal-adequate-set</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Root},\\operatorname{RS}_\\Phi\">\\(\\operatorname{Root},\\operatorname{RS}_\\Phi\\)</span> 在下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Root}(w;W,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in W\\land\\forall v\\in W\\setminus\\{w\\}\\ R(w,v),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RS}_{\\Phi}(\\mathcal M,w)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Root}(w;W,R)\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\mathcal F_m\\ (\\Box_m C\\in\\Phi\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_m(\\Box_m C\\to_m C)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AS}(A;\\mathcal M,w)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{RS}_{\\Phi_A}(\\mathcal M,w).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Root}(w;W,R)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in W\\land\\forall v\\in W\\setminus\\{w\\}\\ R(w,v),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RS}_{\\Phi}(\\mathcal M,w)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Root}(w;W,R)\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\mathcal F_m\\ (\\Box_m C\\in\\Phi\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_m(\\Box_m C\\to_m C)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AS}(A;\\mathcal M,w)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{RS}_{\\Phi_A}(\\mathcal M,w).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只对给定公式集中的方框子式要求根满足反射；不要求每个世界满足全部反射实例。该限制是 S 的局部语义所需，不能误作全框架的自反性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_A\">\\(\\Phi_A\\)</span> 是指定的有限 adequate 闭包；用该闭包足以覆盖原书的最小闭包约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-adequate-set","status":"resolved","id":"67a60f891de62bc0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-adequate-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"91aa38d1fd431425","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"91aa38d1fd431425","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle$ 使用 [[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]，$w\\in W$，$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m$；$\\Phi_A$ 取 [[72-df-modal-adequate-set]]。$\\operatorname{Root},\\operatorname{RS}_\\Phi$ 在下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-adequate-set","status":"resolved","id":"67a60f891de62bc0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle$ 使用 [[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]，$w\\in W$，$A\\in\\mathcal F_m$，$\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m$；$\\Phi_A$ 取 [[72-df-modal-adequate-set]]。$\\operatorname{Root},\\operatorname{RS}_\\Phi$ 在下式定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Root},\\operatorname{RS}_\\Phi","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Root}(w;W,R)&:\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in W\\land\\forall v\\in W\\setminus\\{w\\}\\ R(w,v),\\\\\n\\operatorname{RS}_{\\Phi}(\\mathcal M,w)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Root}(w;W,R)\\land\n\\forall C\\in\\mathcal F_m\\ (\\Box_m C\\in\\Phi\\Rightarrow\n\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_m(\\Box_m C\\to_m C)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{AS}(A;\\mathcal M,w)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{RS}_{\\Phi_A}(\\mathcal M,w).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\Phi_A","display":false}],"bytes":1785,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-170","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-thm-finite-frame-magari-algebra]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-existence]] · [[72-thm-gl-fixed-point-uniqueness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-167","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增12项：[[72-cor-gl-fixed-point-equivalence]] · [[72-df-magari-algebra]] · [[72-df-modal-guarded-context]] · [[72-df-modal-reflection-logic]] · [[72-df-root-sound-modal-model]] · [[72-ex-gl-consistency-fixed-point]] · [[72-ex-gl-semantic-noncompactness]] · [[72-lem-modal-guarded-replacement]] · [[72-lem-modal-root-duplication]] · [[72-t